  "decisions": [
    "Only Phase006 is authorized; Phase007 is not started.",
    "Recover the preexisting unsealed edits with their recorded hashes. Preflight replays the unchanged synced main commit in a clean local clone; it does not pretend the resumed working tree was clean.",
    "Retain installed Prisma 6.19.0 and pin both packages exactly; use strict tr46 6.0.0 UTS46 non-transitional conversion and @types/tr46 5.0.1. Node domainToASCII uses URL host parsing and silently truncates paths/normalizes numeric IPv4 hosts, which is unsuitable for canonical email identities.",
    "Generate migration via prisma migrate dev --create-only, rename the unapplied initial directory to 20260910000000_init_user, add named CHECK constraints, then run the exact required migrate-dev apply command. Never use db push.",
    "All database commands use a labeled Phase006 Docker container, a pinned PostgreSQL 17 image digest, a task-owned bridge with IP masquerading disabled, loopback-only published port and phase006_disposable_* databases. Generated credentials stay in ignored .scaffold only.",
    "Unit tests run in Node; explicit Vitest integration config preserves the injected disposable DATABASE_URL instead of the shared setup overriding it. Default Vitest discovery continues covering both src and tests.",
    "The fixed 13 card cases retain denominator 13. Existing quality commands, source integrity and boundary regression are mandatory supplementary evidence audited before metadata.",
    "Independent review PHASE006-REVIEW-001 is resolved by CHECKPOINT_DISABLE=1 and actual CLI/fork network probes; the deliberately enabled control is blocked before public I/O."
  ],
